{
  "$schema": "https://vega.github.io/schema/vega-lite/v5.json",
  "description": "CHART GROUP: 'Find your state' explorer (Section 4, wide card). Three charts side by side, all driven by the PARAMS below: 'yi' = the year slider (0-10), 'yrLabel' = turns the slider number into a year like '2024-25' (also shown in big type above the maps by js/embed.js), 'pick' = the state clicked on either map (starts on Victoria).",
  "params": [
    {
      "name": "yi",
      "value": 10,
      "bind": {
        "input": "range",
        "min": 0,
        "max": 10,
        "step": 1,
        "name": "Year"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "yrLabel",
      "expr": "['2014-15','2015-16','2016-17','2017-18','2018-19','2019-20','2020-21','2021-22','2022-23','2023-24','2024-25'][yi]"
    },
    {
      "name": "pick",
      "select": {
        "type": "point",
        "fields": [
          "state"
        ],
        "toggle": false,
        "clear": false
      },
      "value": [
        {
          "state": "Victoria"
        }
      ],
      "views": [
        "choro",
        "symDots"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "hconcat": [
    {
      "description": "MAP 1 - CHOROPLETH 'Digital share of loans (%)'. js/embed.js resizes all three charts to equal widths that fill the card. Transforms: keep only the slider's year (datum.idx == yi), then 'lookup' joins each state's row to its shape in aus_states.topojson. Colour: light to dark teal = low to high digital share (0-45%). Clicked state gets a dark outline. CHANNELS: shape = geo (geojson); colour = digital_share (quantitative); outline changes when selected in pick; outline width changes when selected in pick.",
      "name": "choro",
      "width": 340,
      "height": 290,
      "projection": {
        "type": "mercator"
      },
      "title": {
        "text": "Digital share of loans (%)",
        "fontSize": 16
      },
      "data": {
        "url": "data/state_year.csv"
      },
      "transform": [
        {
          "filter": "datum.idx == yi"
        },
        {
          "lookup": "state",
          "from": {
            "data": {
              "url": "data/aus_states.topojson",
              "format": {
                "type": "topojson",
                "feature": "states"
              }
            },
            "key": "properties.STATE_NAME"
          },
          "as": "geo"
        }
      ],
      "mark": {
        "type": "geoshape",
        "cursor": "pointer"
      },
      "encoding": {
        "shape": {
          "field": "geo",
          "type": "geojson"
        },
        "color": {
          "field": "digital_share",
          "type": "quantitative",
          "title": "Digital %",
          "scale": {
            "domain": [
              0,
              45
            ],
            "range": [
              "#eef6f4",
              "#13827f",
              "#0b4f4d"
            ]
          },
          "legend": {
            "orient": "bottom",
            "direction": "horizontal",
            "gradientLength": 180,
            "titleOrient": "left"
          }
        },
        "stroke": {
          "condition": {
            "param": "pick",
            "empty": false,
            "value": "#2d2a26"
          },
          "value": "white"
        },
        "strokeWidth": {
          "condition": {
            "param": "pick",
            "empty": false,
            "value": 2.5
          },
          "value": 0.8
        },
        "tooltip": [
          {
            "field": "state",
            "title": "State"
          },
          {
            "field": "year",
            "title": "Year"
          },
          {
            "field": "digital_share",
            "title": "Digital share (%)"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "description": "MAP 2 - PROPORTIONAL SYMBOL MAP 'In-person visits (millions)'.",
      "name": "symbols",
      "width": 340,
      "height": 290,
      "projection": {
        "type": "mercator"
      },
      "title": {
        "text": "In-person visits (millions)",
        "fontSize": 16
      },
      "layer": [
        {
          "description": "SYMBOL MAP LAYER 1 - THE BEIGE STATE SHAPES underneath.",
          "data": {
            "url": "data/aus_states.topojson",
            "format": {
              "type": "topojson",
              "feature": "states"
            }
          },
          "mark": {
            "type": "geoshape",
            "fill": "#e9e2d4",
            "stroke": "white"
          }
        },
        {
          "description": "SYMBOL MAP LAYER 2 - THE CIRCLES. Placed at each state's lon/lat, circle AREA = visits that year (millions). Every circle is the same amber; the clicked state gets a dark outline instead (stroke condition on 'pick'), so no circle looks less important. Named 'symDots' so the 'pick' click works on it. CHANNELS: longitude = lon (quantitative); latitude = lat (quantitative); size = onsite_visits (quantitative); colour fixed at #d4901c; outline changes when selected in pick; outline width changes when selected in pick.",
          "name": "symDots",
          "data": {
            "url": "data/state_year.csv"
          },
          "transform": [
            {
              "filter": "datum.idx == yi"
            }
          ],
          "mark": {
            "type": "circle",
            "cursor": "pointer",
            "opacity": 0.95
          },
          "encoding": {
            "longitude": {
              "field": "lon",
              "type": "quantitative"
            },
            "latitude": {
              "field": "lat",
              "type": "quantitative"
            },
            "size": {
              "field": "onsite_visits",
              "type": "quantitative",
              "title": "Visits (millions)",
              "scale": {
                "domain": [
                  0,
                  36
                ],
                "range": [
                  0,
                  2200
                ]
              },
              "legend": {
                "orient": "bottom",
                "direction": "horizontal",
                "values": [
                  1,
                  10,
                  25
                ],
                "titleOrient": "left",
                "symbolFillColor": "#d4901c",
                "symbolStrokeColor": "white"
              }
            },
            "color": {
              "value": "#d4901c"
            },
            "stroke": {
              "condition": {
                "param": "pick",
                "empty": false,
                "value": "#2d2a26"
              },
              "value": "white"
            },
            "strokeWidth": {
              "condition": {
                "param": "pick",
                "empty": false,
                "value": 2.5
              },
              "value": 1
            },
            "tooltip": [
              {
                "field": "state",
                "title": "State"
              },
              {
                "field": "year",
                "title": "Year"
              },
              {
                "field": "onsite_visits",
                "title": "Visits (millions)"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "description": "SYMBOL MAP LAYER 3 - NUMBER INSIDE THE BIG CIRCLES (5 million visits or more), in white. CHANNELS: longitude = lon (quantitative); latitude = lat (quantitative); text = onsite_visits (quantitative).",
          "data": {
            "url": "data/state_year.csv"
          },
          "transform": [
            {
              "filter": "datum.idx == yi && datum.onsite_visits >= 5"
            }
          ],
          "mark": {
            "type": "text",
            "fontSize": 12,
            "fontWeight": "bold",
            "color": "white"
          },
          "encoding": {
            "longitude": {
              "field": "lon",
              "type": "quantitative"
            },
            "latitude": {
              "field": "lat",
              "type": "quantitative"
            },
            "text": {
              "field": "onsite_visits",
              "type": "quantitative",
              "format": ".1f"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "description": "SYMBOL MAP LAYER 4 - NUMBER BESIDE THE SMALL CIRCLES (under 5 million), placed to the right because they don't fit inside. CHANNELS: longitude = lon (quantitative); latitude = lat (quantitative); text = onsite_visits (quantitative).",
          "data": {
            "url": "data/state_year.csv"
          },
          "transform": [
            {
              "filter": "datum.idx == yi && datum.onsite_visits < 5"
            }
          ],
          "mark": {
            "type": "text",
            "fontSize": 11,
            "fontWeight": "bold",
            "color": "#2d2a26",
            "align": "left",
            "dx": 11
          },
          "encoding": {
            "longitude": {
              "field": "lon",
              "type": "quantitative"
            },
            "latitude": {
              "field": "lat",
              "type": "quantitative"
            },
            "text": {
              "field": "onsite_visits",
              "type": "quantitative",
              "format": ".1f"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "description": "CHART 3 - '<state>: items borrowed per person' STACKED BARS. Shows the clicked state only (filter on 'pick'). 'fold' turns the physical and digital columns into rows so they can stack; 'per_person' divides each by the state's population that year (ABS estimated resident population, in state_year.csv) so small and large states can be compared. The y axis is fixed at 0-10 items per person. The slider's year is solid, other years faded (opacity test on yrLabel). CHANNELS: x position = year (ordinal); y position = sum of per_person (quantitative); colour = format (nominal); line/stack order = format; opacity changes when datum.year == yrLabel.",
      "name": "detail",
      "width": 340,
      "height": 250,
      "title": {
        "text": {
          "expr": "(pick && pick.state ? pick.state[0] : 'All states') + ': items borrowed per person'"
        },
        "fontSize": 16
      },
      "data": {
        "url": "data/state_year.csv",
        "format": {
          "parse": {
            "population": "number",
            "physical": "number",
            "digital": "number"
          }
        }
      },
      "transform": [
        {
          "filter": {
            "param": "pick"
          }
        },
        {
          "fold": [
            "physical",
            "digital"
          ],
          "as": [
            "format",
            "millions"
          ]
        },
        {
          "calculate": "datum.format=='physical' ? 'Physical' : 'Digital'",
          "as": "format"
        },
        {
          "calculate": "datum.millions * 1000000 / datum.population",
          "as": "per_person"
        }
      ],
      "mark": {
        "type": "bar",
        "width": {
          "band": 0.7
        }
      },
      "encoding": {
        "x": {
          "field": "year",
          "type": "ordinal",
          "title": null,
          "axis": {
            "labelAngle": -45,
            "labelExpr": "slice(datum.label,2,4)+'–'+slice(datum.label,5,7)"
          }
        },
        "y": {
          "aggregate": "sum",
          "field": "per_person",
          "type": "quantitative",
          "title": null,
          "scale": {
            "domain": [
              0,
              10
            ]
          },
          "axis": {
            "labelFlush": true
          }
        },
        "color": {
          "field": "format",
          "type": "nominal",
          "scale": {
            "domain": [
              "Physical",
              "Digital"
            ],
            "range": [
              "#c0532b",
              "#13827f"
            ]
          },
          "legend": {
            "orient": "bottom",
            "title": null
          }
        },
        "order": {
          "field": "format",
          "sort": "descending"
        },
        "opacity": {
          "condition": {
            "test": "datum.year == yrLabel",
            "value": 1
          },
          "value": 0.35
        },
        "tooltip": [
          {
            "field": "year",
            "title": "Year"
          },
          {
            "field": "format",
            "title": "Format"
          },
          {
            "aggregate": "sum",
            "field": "per_person",
            "title": "Items per person",
            "format": ".1f"
          },
          {
            "aggregate": "sum",
            "field": "millions",
            "title": "Items (millions)",
            "format": ".1f"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "spacing": 36,
  "resolve": {
    "scale": {
      "color": "independent",
      "size": "independent"
    },
    "legend": {
      "color": "independent"
    }
  }
}